codex
The restriction is specific to Python child processes writing into the workspace; they can write to temp, and `apply_patch` can write the workspace. I’ll keep the verifier’s normal behavior, add a fallback that writes the JSON to stdout when workspace output is blocked, then materialize the exact generated JSON into the required file.
